---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About EU DPP Provider | Enterprise Compliance & Sovereign Data Vault"
  description="Learn about EU DPP Provider: Our mission, 3-layer architecture, 10-year data hosting SLA, and cross-border battery compliance engineering."
>

  <!-- ==================== HERO SECTION (Clean Neomorphic Surface) ==================== -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    
    <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-6 mx-auto">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-600"></span>
      <span>About EU DPP Provider · Enterprise Profile</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-[56px] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.12] text-slate-900 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      Turning Regulatory Complexity into <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
      <span class="text-cyan-600">Audit-Ready Data Chains</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      EU DPP Provider is a specialized compliance technology vendor and data vault operator. We bridge global battery manufacturers, European automotive OEMs, and EU market surveillance authorities through standardized, privacy-preserving Digital Product Passports.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 items-center">
      <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="neo-btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>Contact Business Desk: info@eudppprovider.com</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="neo-pill px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 hover:text-cyan-700">
        <span>Request Technical Briefing →</span>
      </a>
    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- ==================== CORE PHILOSOPHY ==================== -->
  <section class="py-16 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-2">Our Engineering Principles</div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Four Non-Negotiable Axioms
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">
        Why leading battery cell makers, pack assemblers, and BESS integrators choose our compliance architecture.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      
      <div class="neo-surface p-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base mb-4">
          01
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Connect, Don't Replace</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          We operate as a read-only middleware layer between ERP, MES, PLM, and BMS. We do not replace your core systems or disrupt factory execution.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-green-100 text-green-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base mb-4">
          02
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Dual-System Reuse</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Collect once, deploy twice. Our unified data model aligns EU 70+ mandatory fields with China 96-item national traceability code (24-digit ID).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base mb-4">
          03
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Zero-Knowledge Shield</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Domestic computation with whitelist filtering. Only required regulatory fields cross borders, safeguarding proprietary chemistry and BOM pricing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base mb-4">
          04
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">10-Year Lifecycle SLA</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          A battery passport must survive until recycling. We guarantee 10-year hosting, 99.9% uptime, and mandatory EU regulatory adaptations within 30 days.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- ==================== 3-LAYER ARCHITECTURE ==================== -->
  <section class="py-16 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-2">Technical Foundation</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          A Robust Three-Tier Data Chain
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          The engineering effort of a battery passport lies 80% in upstream supply chain ingestion. Our layered architecture decouples industrial connectivity from regulatory publication.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-3.5">
          <div class="neo-well p-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs">
              <span>L3 · Application & Publication Layer</span>
              <span class="text-cyan-700 font-mono text-[10px]">Public / NB / Recycler</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
              Generates 4-tier role-based QR portals, eIDAS 2.0 digital signatures, and automated EU Registry UPI synchronization.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="neo-well p-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs">
              <span>L2 · Governance & Calculation Layer</span>
              <span class="text-green-700 font-mono text-[10px]">7 Data Domains Model</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
              Standardized mapping rules, PEFCR carbon footprint modeling, OECD due diligence verification, and quality audit scoring.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="neo-well p-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs">
              <span>L1 · Read-Only Connection Layer</span>
              <span class="text-slate-800 font-mono text-[10px]">ERP / MES / PLM / BMS</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
              Non-intrusive connectors, incremental data sync, supplier portal uploads, and real-time anomaly alerts.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Global Operations & Hubs</h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs">
          <div class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-3.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>🇩🇪 Frankfurt & Munich, Germany</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-cyan-600">EU Sovereign Vault</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-500 mt-1">
              Hosting nodes in ISO 27001 data centers, eIDAS QTSP certificate handling, and direct EU Commission Registry interface.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-3.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>🇨🇳 Shanghai & Shenzhen, China</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-cyan-600">Supply Chain Integration</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-500 mt-1">
              Factory MES/laser serialization engineers, upstream supplier data collection, and domestic border security governance.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Official Business Inquiries</div>
            <p class="text-slate-500">
              Direct all procurement, technical consultation, and partnership requests to our dedicated desk:
            </p>
            <div class="mt-2.5 p-3 neo-well flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-mono font-bold text-navy-900 text-xs">info@eudppprovider.com</span>
              <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-700 hover:text-cyan-800">Send Email →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- ==================== FINAL ACTION CARD ==================== -->
  <section class="py-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-12 text-center">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-3 mx-auto">Get in Touch</div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Connect with Our Compliance Architects
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Speak directly with our technical leadership to review your battery portfolio and architecture requirements.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="neo-btn-primary">
          Contact: info@eudppprovider.com
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
